Concerning the Five Things which
33 — were established in the bodies — 33
that are strong, of the archons.
Once again the Illuminator said: The Living Projection established {42}
great things through the veins and the canals{43}
which are strong.
The first is the disc which is set upon the {44}
shoulder of the Omophoros.
The {45}second is the foreparts of the {46}
Pillar that stretches forth in its midst.
{47}The third is the {48}
molding of the form{49}ation of the Gehennas.
The fourth is the {50}
pillars that are set on their feet in the great sea, in the {51}
seventh kind of the cosmos.
The fifth is the four
walls that surround the strongholds.
